      "id": "claim_f1f97e803c664152969cefb0c895bf18",
      "statement": "`entrypoints/const.py` holds the shared vocabulary with no protocol mention: `Layer` (a `StrEnum` of `features`/`app_services`, the bus's own vocabulary that also names the RPC method namespace and the MCP/OpenRPC tag), `Scalar = dict[str, Any]`, `BINARY_TYPES`, `BINARY_JSON_FORMATS`, `TRACE_KEYS`, `RunFn = Callable[[Scalar], Scalar]` and `Wrapper = Callable[[RunFn], RunFn]`.",
